.40.260","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/2.40.260","content_hash":"8a7af9642dcd1ecaec66b8a39bc6daa3cd7661cd6f7d7826e32ac7b9402c9102","heading":null,"ordinal":5,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.260:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.260:block:5","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/2.40.260","text":"(i) The person refuses to give a written promise to appear in court when served with a notice to appear;","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"ce90159b-8ea9-5a4f-a9bb-ac08bdd8275b"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"2.40.260","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/2.40.260","content_hash":"9b8c528bfea04141a826c1e9fb28a088238c2d64229db2c0d96c21639b31793f","heading":null,"ordinal":6,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.260:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.260:block:6","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/2.40.260","text":"(ii) The person is unable to provide identification of self by presenting a valid driver’s license or other identification giving equivalent information to the law enforcement officer;","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"db2d0bf2-51f5-5c5c-871d-b7368636c637"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"2.40.260","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/2.40.260","content_hash":"838acf5877e95f224a2b941f32e586a7145f31d1ddccc8ed86c1d2cd2218af6b","heading":null,"ordinal":7,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.260:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.260:block:7","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/2.40.260","text":"(iii) The person is not a resident of the State of Kansas; or","type":"paragraph","workbench_comp